{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">無綫節目《阿爺廚房》中，李家鼎（鼎爺）曾大顯精湛刀工，示範煮這道精緻的家常佳餚「龍躉菊花球」。這道菜式將花尾龍躉炸至外層金黃酥脆，內裏肉質卻依然保持鮮嫩滑溜。其精華在於淋上以鮮橙汁及檸檬汁熬製的醒胃酸甜汁，酸甜果香有效中和炸魚的油膩感，配搭烘香的松子與菠蘿，口感層次極致豐富。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"beeadd79-ce79-457c-bfee-e04e28a428f0.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026VulNT7wadG1784258880.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"beeadd79-ce79-457c-bfee-e04e28a428f0.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong>龍躉菊花球所需材料</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">花尾龍躉、鹽、糖、生粉、橙肉、片糖、甘筍、青豆、菠蘿、松子、紅椒、青椒、檸檬汁</p><h4 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">烹飪步驟</h4><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9d310f57-d825-480f-b138-28a7456e7bee.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026DvwLgt8sid1784258877.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9d310f57-d825-480f-b138-28a7456e7bee.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T01:07:21.194855+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}